        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/29f7e30d547c30ddb7a637bc3a2dbc7c0e3f5469",
          "sha": "29f7e30d547c30ddb7a637bc3a2dbc7c0e3f5469",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/29f7e30d547c30ddb7a637bc3a2dbc7c0e3f5469"
        }
      ],
      "message": "GUARDED_BY annotations for CBlockIndex's nTx, m_chain_tx_count\n\nThe requirement was never made explicit. The nTx field is modified\nwhen the block data is received and m_chain_tx_count is modified\nwhen all ancestors' block data has been received. Because of this,\nreading nTx from the getblockheader RPC may race as it does not\nacquire cs_main. Also, m_chain_tx_count may race in getchaintxstats\nif a pruned node redownloads a block via getblockfrompeer or if\nthe node is running assumeutxo and tries to read m_chain_tx_count\nwhile it is being written to.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Eugene Siegel",
        "email": "elzeigel@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-16T16:34:41Z"
      },
